            <para id="para-00106">Enter the missing numbers, including the signs, for the expression when <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>32</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> is written in vertex form. <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">a</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">b</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">c</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder></m:mrow></m:math></para>
            <para id="para-00107">What is the value of the missing number, including the sign, in place of letter a?</para>
