            <para id="para-00122">Enter the missing numbers, including the signs, for the expression when <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> is expanded to standard form. <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">a</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">b</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">c</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
